WEBVTT

00:04:00.111 --> 00:04:01.279
And collectively,

00:04:01.279 --> 00:04:04.615
we spend twice as much time
watching and playing video games

00:04:04.657 --> 00:04:07.702
as we do using all other forms
of social media combined.

00:04:08.119 --> 00:04:09.787
That's a lot of eyeballs.

00:04:10.371 --> 00:04:11.539
Game sales are huge,

00:04:11.539 --> 00:04:13.624
but the real action
is in in-game economies

00:04:13.666 --> 00:04:16.252
where people spend
over 130 billion dollars a year

00:04:16.252 --> 00:04:18.504
buying and selling virtual goods online.

00:04:18.546 --> 00:04:21.674
Everything from outfits to avatars,
to vehicles to weapons,

00:04:21.716 --> 00:04:24.176
to dances to architecture to music,

00:04:24.176 --> 00:04:26.804
to access to live events and more.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:30.808
Haven't even mentioned NFT or Web3,